# Conformed Veo clips, written by scripts/ingest-ep3-clips.mjs.
#
# Not committed. Fifty-seven clips is well over a gigabyte, and the repo
# rejects any single file over 10 MB. They are a build input regenerated from
# the raw generations, the same way node_modules is regenerated from the lock.
*.mp4

# SHA256SUMS travels inside the transfer bundle; it describes files git ignores.
SHA256SUMS
